[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、スタートしました第二予選！\nビーッグな勝利を飾るのは、誰だー！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And they're off! The second qualifier has begun! Who will claim a MAJORLY big victory?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……始まったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...It's started."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鶏鶏鶏鶏鶏ーーー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chickens, chickens, chickens, chickens, chickens!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "め、目が怖いよヴァレリア！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Y-Your eyes are scary, Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "絶対にララキン鶏を手に入れるのよ！\nレスナも予選上位通過を目指して！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm absolutely going to get those Lara Kingdom chickens! You aim for the top qualifiers too, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "う、うん、頑張る！\u3000二人で最終戦に残れば、\n優勝できる確率は上がるもんね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "R-Right, I'll do my best! If we both make it to the finals, our chances of winning go up!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行けー！\u3000錬金術士レスナ！\u3000あんたなら勝てる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go! Alchemist Resna! You can win this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客Ａ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいや、ヴァレリアだ！\u3000俺はあんたを信じてる！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No way, it's gotta be Valeria! I'm betting on you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客Ｂ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "差せ！\u3000差せー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on! Come on!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客Ｃ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（人々が持つ感情。それが大きく揺れ動くとき。\n\u3000そこにはある種の「力」が生まれる）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The emotions people carry. When they surge and sway dramatically, a certain kind of 'power' is born.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（その力を集めることができれば、\n\u3000我が渇望の糧にできるかもしれない）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(If I can gather that power, I might be able to feed my own desires.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（だから私は、大きく感情を動かすための場を整えた。\n\u3000ララ・ビーチグランプリを利用して）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(That's why I've set the stage to stir those emotions greatly, using the Lara Beach Grand Prix.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（準備に時間はかかった。でも、あなたたちも\n\u3000嬉しいでしょう？）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The preparations took time. But you're all enjoying yourselves, aren't you?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（予想券という、その紙切れ１枚が\n\u3000最高の興奮とスリルをもたらすのだから）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(A single slip of paper—a betting ticket—bringing you the ultimate excitement and thrills.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、あなたたちの感情をさらに揺さぶってあげるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, let me shake your emotions even further!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあああ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Waaaaah?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いたたた！\u3000なによこれ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ow ow ow! What is this thing?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これはいったいどういうことだー！？\n今日の天気はウサギ模様！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What in the world is going on?! Today's weather forecast called for bunny showers?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なにやってんだー！\u3000ちゃんと進めー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What are you doing?! Keep going!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客Ａ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客Ａ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うわあああ、ダメだ！\u3000予想ははずれだあああ！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Noooo, this is bad! My prediction's totally wrong!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客Ｂ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客Ｂ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くっ……なんのこれしき……！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh... this is nothing...!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ララキンどりぃいいい！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lara Kingdom chickeeeeens!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヴァレリア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Valeria"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ゴール！！！\n第二予選１位通過は、ヴァレリアだあああ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "She's crossed the finish line!!! First place in the second qualifier goes to Valeria!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミーケ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mieke"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "わあああああああ！！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeaaaaaaaah!!!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "観客たち",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "観客たち"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふふふ……ははは！\u3000力がみなぎるのを感じるわ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hehehe... ahaha! I can feel the power surging through me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすがね、ワルター。素晴らしい仕事だわ。\nあなたの仕込んだ機構は目論見通り働いた",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excellent work, Walther. Your contraptions worked exactly as planned."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それじゃあ……渇望のため、動き始めるとしましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then... let's begin moving for the sake of my desires."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クリセルダ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Criselda"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]